<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The themed icon layer, for the Android 13 and later setting that recolours
  every launcher icon from the wallpaper palette. This device has it on, so
  for its owner this file *is* the icon and the green one is never seen.

  The same drawing in one colour. The system tints it and reads only the
  alpha, so the white here never reaches the screen. It is a separate file
  rather than a reuse of the foreground because the two will diverge:
  anything that leans on the green against the dark background has to be
  solved another way when both are somebody's wallpaper.
-->
